Loop notes:
- Slices 1-10 of IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN are complete; every acceptance criterion in the
  spec is covered by a test.
- Idempotence hinges on resolve_secrets() reading /etc/smallapp/NAME.env back rather
  than regenerating; without that, apply #2 rewrites the env file and prints a second
  token.
- Static units deliberately get BOTH a file_server vhost (Caddy serves bytes) and an
  app service running python3 -m http.server. The service is what gives the gateway an
  upstream in the e2e test and keeps status/restart uniform. Spec amended to say so.
- systemd hardening was written to score <4.0 but has never been measured: this
  machine is macOS. First Linux run of tests/test_hardening.py is the real check.
- e2e substitutes only the port numbers and prefixes /opt/smallapp paths; the ExecStart
  strings and env file are used as rendered.
- Spec amendments this loop: status/doctor take --root (tests need it), doctor lives in
  system.preflight, Unit lives in naming.py, static-unit service documented.
